            <ArticleTitle>Using PDE inhibitors to harness the benefits of calorie restriction: lessons from resveratrol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>144-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In conclusion, the discovery of the resveratrol-PDE link suggests that PDE4 inhibitors, possibly in combination with other PDE inhibitors, may be useful for mimicking CR and for treating aging-related diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
